Historically, the Faction SSBE will be linked to "The Soviet International Congress" Which is tightly controlled by the soviet union, but becoming weaker by the year. Within one year in game time there will be a referendum in the congress pushed by all SSBE members outside of a larger in game CSTO that will form from the fall of the SSBE

-As well, the fall of the SSBE leads to NATO allowing the freedoms of various Countries, while still holding some territores (for example, Ireland and Brittany)

AMERICAN OCCUPIED ZONE OF EUROPE MECHANICS

There are going to be 8+ major paths this country can take, but for documentation purposes for now two will be focused on. Response to the Soviet Collapse is a direct response to the Fall of the SSBE and will focus primarily on democratisation of the european region and liberalisation.

